WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.588
Your coding agents

00:00:01.635 --> 00:00:02.732
playing like music

00:00:02.543 --> 00:00:03.368
on your Mac

00:00:03.894 --> 00:00:05.120
AgentSaver is a

00:00:04.932 --> 00:00:06.146
Mac screen saver

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:07.172
for coding agents

00:00:07.311 --> 00:00:08.242
Claude Code

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:09.881
Codex and OpenCode

00:00:09.693 --> 00:00:10.660
keep working while

00:00:10.471 --> 00:00:11.697
their replies stream

00:00:11.521 --> 00:00:12.440
across the lock

00:00:12.252 --> 00:00:13.419
screen like song

00:00:13.231 --> 00:00:13.973
lyrics

00:00:14.494 --> 00:00:15.873
Frosted cards sit

00:00:15.685 --> 00:00:16.569
under the clock

00:00:16.381 --> 00:00:17.277
where Now Playing

00:00:17.088 --> 00:00:17.536
would

00:00:17.702 --> 00:00:18.786
showing the task

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:20.130
its progress and

00:00:19.942 --> 00:00:20.979
the command running

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:21.534
right now

00:00:21.673 --> 00:00:22.757
You skip between

00:00:22.581 --> 00:00:23.889
agents like tracks

00:00:24.422 --> 00:00:25.542
It reads sessions

00:00:25.354 --> 00:00:26.509
already running with

00:00:26.321 --> 00:00:27.370
zero setup

00:00:27.441 --> 00:00:28.514
and an optional

00:00:28.325 --> 00:00:29.327
Claude Code hook

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:30.813
flags approval requests

00:00:30.952 --> 00:00:33.334
It costs 7.99 dollars

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:34.884
Full story on

00:00:34.695 --> 00:00:35.591
the dashboard
